## 2026-08-13 Update – Implement 0.003 lookup API

- Summary: Albert granted IAM + Lambda full access; implemented and deployed `POST /v1/check`.
- Package: `packages/lookup-api` (mapStatus, Dynamo GetItem, handler); 9 unit tests passing.
- Infra: `infra/lookup_lambda.tf` — role `webnotary-dev-lookup-role`, function `webnotary-dev-lookup`, route on existing HTTP API.
- Smoke tests against `https://5jdix54pag.execute-api.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/v1/check`:
  - unknown → `{"status":"unknown"}`
  - seeded `SINGLE_OBSERVED` → `valid`
  - `CONFLICT` → `conflict`
  - bad fingerprint → 400
- Follow-up: PR when human requests; next feature 0.004 TLS observer (local) or 0.005 verification orchestration.

## 2026-08-13 Update – Implement 0.004 TLS observer (CLI)

- Summary: Built `@webnotary/observer` with SSRF-safe DNS/IP policy, TLS:443+SNI observe, leaf/SPKI fingerprints, and `webnotary-observer` CLI.
- Branch: `0.004-tls-observer`
- Tests: 9/9 unit tests; smoke observe `example.com` succeeded (`tlsValid: true`).
- Milestone check: seeded observed fingerprint into DynamoDB as `SINGLE_OBSERVED`; `/v1/check` returned `valid`.
- Deferred: Lambda/SQS packaging to 0.005.

## 2026-08-13 Update – Implement 0.005 verification orchestration

- Summary: Wired unknown `/v1/check` to pending dedupe + SQS; deployed observer Lambda that observes, writes S3 evidence, upserts `SINGLE_OBSERVED`, clears pending.
- Packages: lookup-api enqueue/sightings; new `packages/verification-worker`.
- Infra: `observer_lambda.tf`; lookup IAM/env gains queue send + DDB writes.
- E2E: unknown client FP for example.com → worker evidence in S3 → `/v1/check` with observed FP returns `valid`.
- Interim: no CT gate yet (hostname-deduped probes only).
- Follow-up: PR; then 0.006 CT inventory.
